@startuml
title Step 5 - Customer Information required (capture appointment, address, contact, billing)

actor person
participant "EngagementManagement" as EM
participant "ProductOrderCapture\n& Validation" as POCV
participant "PartyManagement" as PM
participant "BillingAccountMgt" as BAM
participant "ProductInventory" as PI

activate EM

== Choose Appointment ==
person -> EM : 100 choose appointment\nday and hour

== Add a legal address ==
person -> EM : 101 same address than the one\nused for the delivery

== Add Contact Method ==
person -> EM : 102 provide contactMethod

== Choose Billing Options ==
person -> EM : 103 choose day of the bill

== Send information to the process ==
EM -> POCV : 104 **TMF701 Process** PATCH /process/4/task/8\nSessionId, day=1
activate POCV

opt
    POCV -> POCV : 105 check information Product Inventory updated
    POCV -> PI : 106 **TMF637 Product Inventory Mgt** PATCH /product/?
    activate PI
    PI --> POCV : 107 **TMF637** 200 OK\nProduct representation
    deactivate PI
end

POCV -> POCV : 108 **TMF622 Product Order Mgt** PATCH /productOrder/7\n(billingAccount456)
deactivate POCV
deactivate EM

@enduml
